generator_ts_return.vlt:24:38: error: the second type argument of `Iterator` is the error type it throws, and `User[]` is not an error type
TypeScript allows this (`Iterator<T, TReturn>`, which takes the return type second); Velt doesn't because a finished `IteratorResult` carries no value and `next()` takes no argument, so `Iterator<T, E>` takes the error type `E` second; write `Iterator<f64>`, or `Iterator<f64, E>` with the error class `E` it throws
